{"version":1,"content":"<p>美國總統特朗普周二（3日）接受霍士新聞訪問時表示，美國跟以色列於數月前達成了協議，今年底將中止每年給予以色列38億美元（約296億港元）軍事援助，被視為重大政治轉向。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-04T07:25:59.093476+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":83,"images":0,"source":"明報 國際","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-04T06:59:37+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-04T07:18:37.984307+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-04T07:18:37.984307+00:00","content_hash":"af9f3a4094d8cf1707910a6c02f3242a43722b8b61ebd366121a98bfd6fd5e38","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}